# Copy to samba.env (install.sh does it, and fills SAMBA_USER_1). Format "name;password;uid;group;gid": install.sh
# asks the name (WPKG_SAMBA_USER, default administrateur), gives a dedicated uid (70000, or the next number that no
# account of the host has, never the one of the owner of services/samba/share) and the gid of the group of that
# folder; the group must be wpkg, which smb.conf lets in (valid users = @wpkg); letters and digits only in the
# password. The image variable is SAMBA_USER_1 (it was USER_1 with dperson/samba).
SAMBA_USER_1=
